From 89e30cf1af9dd463ead3e5b73c0320ee28aff94d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 05:51:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/16] cli: built-in orchestration runtime; QuickJS end-to-end
 and parity specs in cargo

The runtime's sources (and the ignore package it bundles) are embedded in
the binary and written once per content hash to the private workflow
cache, so codemod workflow run -w workflow.ts needs no checkout;
CODEMOD_ORCHESTRATION_SRC still points it at a checkout's sources.

The QuickJS end-to-end and JSSG parity specs move from vitest to cargo
and drive the codemod binary: 38 + 28 specs, about 3.7 s. The encoding
case now runs the YAML engine in the same binary.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
